    <string name="screen_recording_subtext">Records the WHOLE device screen for the duration of each trip, using Android\'s own screen-capture permission -- not just this app\'s UI. If you switch to another app mid-trip (messages, banking, anything), that is captured too. Off by default. Recordings are saved privately on this device only, never uploaded anywhere.</string>
